STEER Copyright & License Template
==================================

Standard header for new STEER source files. The Author line is an example; name the
actual contributor when you use it.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Markdown / JSON
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

<!--
Copyright (c) 2026 Bill French (832Labs)

SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
-->

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Python Files (.py)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

"""
<filename> — <short description>

Author: <contributor>

Copyright (c) 2026 Bill French (832Labs)

SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
"""

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Plain Copyright Line
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Copyright (c) 2026 Bill French (832Labs)
Licensed under the MIT License
